I've seen very *strage* number pad behaviour, too.  

In mac_windows mode:
--------------------
!number_pad = letter direction keys work, keypad works as direction keys  
              ("5" = "open door")
number_pad = letter direction keys don't work, neither does keypad.

In tty mode:
------------
!number_pad = letter directions keys work, keypad works as numbers. ("count =")
number_pad = letter direction keys don't work, keypad works as direction keys.
             ("5n" = "continue to go in direction n until as long as you can.")

